Package: mepsCalibrate
Type: Package
Title: Calibrate Self-Reported Survey Data to Objective Measured Anchors
Version: 0.1.0
Author: AI Collaborator & User
Maintainer: User <user@example.com>
Description: Functions to handle digit preference heaping and survey tail 
    truncation by mapping self-reported datasets (MEPS/NHIS) to continuous, 
    measured reference distributions (NHANES) via continuous age-conditional 
    quantile regression splines.
